WEBVTT

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.850
It can't be! it can't be!

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.110
It just can't be!

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.700
The Prism Hopish has been taken away.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.040
We have to hurry, and save the Stone Keeper

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.080
who was taken along with the four stones.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.950
But that guy's strength is incredible...

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.910
He's totally different from the others 
we've dealt with up until now.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.080
We're no match for him.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.520
What should we do?

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:42.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:48.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:58.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.800
Listen, everyone!

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.350
This is an emergency situation.

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:16.340
We've not only lost power, but the 
telephone doesn't work either.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.140
Let's all go to bed early tonight,

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:22.260
and when morning comes, 
we'll go down the mountain.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.720
Don't worry. We'll all make it safely home.

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:30.830
Let's all pray to the mountain 
god that you can get home safely,

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:35.440
and see your mothers and fathers again.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.660
Vice Principal...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.640
It's not as if we're lost in the mountains.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.980
That's true.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:47.470
The most important thing in a situation 
like this is to remain calm.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:51.220
Help each other out, and stay calm.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.360
The principal is right.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.080
As soon as we finish dinner, 
we'll all go straight to bed,

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.760
so let's all start preparing for that now.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.150
Aren't you scared, Nagisa?

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:05.860
Nagisa!

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.660
What?

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.500
Stop it! Will you just stop it!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.540
The way you're acting is making me nervous.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.640
I'm sorry.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.630
Yukishiro-san...?

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.720
Can you explain what's going on here?

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.420
So, you have no idea either.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:32.590
"THE SHOWDOWN!
 PRETTY CURE VS ILKUBO"

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:51.860
It's no good.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.680
We can't summon the Stone 
Keeper anymore mepo.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.380
We have to go look for the 
Keeper and the Prism Stones...

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.180
Mipple! Don't be hasty mepo.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:06.820
If we're not careful, the Prism 
Stones could be in danger, too mepo!

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:08.430
I know it's dangerous mipo!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.240
If all of you won't go, 
then I'll go myself mipo!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:12.750
Mipple!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.530
Mipple!

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.690
Calm down mepo.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.910
I want to get the Prism Hopish back, 
too, but how are we supposed to do it?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:35.390
He said that he's coming right 
back to get the other two stones.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.570
What are we going to do?

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.370
Are we strong enough to protect everyone?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:53.460
Even in the summer, it's 
cold in the mountains...

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.160
Is it my imagination?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.040
What if a ghost appears?

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.640
I suddenly don't...

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.560
I must have fallen asleep.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.440
It sure is quiet.

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.970
What happened to everybody?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.990
Hurry, and get up!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.580
It's morning!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.530
Shiho! Why are you sleeping here?

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.250
Shiho!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.700
What's going on here?

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:46.940
Nagisa!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.590
Honoka...?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.690
I'm so glad.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.060
Are you okay, Nagisa?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.830
What do you mean?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.360
There's something wrong with everyone here.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.860
You must be kidding!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.580
Akane-san! Pull yourself together, Akane-san!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:03.780
Wake up!

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.900
It's no good. No one in the 
other rooms will wake up either.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.880
What's going on anyway?

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.180
Don't tell me that this is...?

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:18.600
We'd better let the teachers know.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.630
You're kidding!

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:30.560
Not the vice principal, 
too. This is terrible!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.570
Nagisa!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.960
The principal is unconscious, too.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.370
What are we going to do?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.440
Nagisa!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.720
I have a really, really bad 
feeling about this mepo!

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.070
I do, too mipo!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.710
I'm sure it's him mipo!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:45.910
It's just as we thought.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:47.590
He's coming mepo.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:47.590
He's coming mipo.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.810
What did you do to everyone anyway?

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:19.170
Are you talking about everyone 
who's asleep in the mountain villa?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.610
All of their life force... 
Their spirits are here.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.300
Restore them all to the way they were!

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:25.590
That's impossible.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.760
This all belongs to Jyaku-King now.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.730
I won't let you get away with 
playing with people's lives.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:33.030
Is that right?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.290
Then will you fight me to get it back?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:38.900
I never thought two young girls 
could be so much trouble...

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:42.700
Now give me the last two stones!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.240
You know we can't do that!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.630
Stop bluffing!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:50.720
You're not as strong as you think you are!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:54.130
Everything is according to Jyaku-King's will!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:03.880
Nagisa!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.150
Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:21.050
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.260
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:15.000
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.860
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.260
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.710
Go back to where you came from!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.670
No matter what you do, it 
won't make any difference.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.830
You don't learn, do you?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.860
Your fates are all right here in my hand.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:16.360
Those who go against Jyaku-King's 
will are banished by this hand.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:21.330
Let me give you a glimpse of 
what your future will look like.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.380
It's useless to fight it.

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:49.490
You can no longer escape from 
the great power of darkness.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.830
Isn't this an appropriate 
scene for your graves?

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:57.490
I'm not going to my grave!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.600
Black!

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.140
White! Pull yourself together mipo!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.530
Black! Are you okay mepo?

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.710
You're no match for him, after all mepo.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.980
Until everyone is brought back to normal...

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.670
We won't be defeated!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.320
If you're buried under all that rubble,

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.630
it'll be too much trouble 
to look for the stones.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:02.600
Now give me the stones!

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.960
We won't give them to you.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.060
Never!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.040
You just won't listen to reason, will you?

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:17.850
White! Let's use the Marble Screw!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.770
But it didn't have any 
effect at all yesterday.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.830
Let's just do what we can.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.310
Black Thunder!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.990
White Thunder!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.640
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:43.500
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.060
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.720
No matter how many times you 
try, it'll be the same thing!

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.130
It's no good, after all.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.800
There's no way we can defeat him.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.390
Don't give up!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.900
But... But unless there's a miracle,

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.370
there's no way we can 
defeat someone like him.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.320
Then... then we'll make a miracle happen!

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.140
Make our own miracle?

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:17.720
That's right.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:20.560
Do you want to let him 
continue to beat us up?

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.090
Doesn't it make you angry?

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.720
No matter what I have to do,

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.770
I won't be satisfied until I can 
deal him a devastating blow!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:27.550
Black...

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.530
Just what I'd expect from 
the legendary warrior mepo.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:34.900
Honoka... No matter what 
happens, I'm with you mipo!

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:38.530
Now is the time to show him the power 
of the legendary warriors mipo!

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:40.070
Mipple...

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:42.960
Do you see that pendant on his chest...?

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.600
Just aim for that!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.870
You don't give up, do you?

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.200
You're just wasting your time.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.670
Not yet!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:14.760
I hit it!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.100
We made our own miracle!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.010
We can do it if we try.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.820
I'm not holding back anymore!

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:54.600
This is the end!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:58.090
What's wrong, Mepple?

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.870
Something's pulling me mepo!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.680
Help me mipo!

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:03.490
Mipple!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.780
It's no use mepo!

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:14.750
The Prism Stone...

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.230
The Prism Stone!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:30.140
He... took my Prism Stone mepo.

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:31.600
Mine, too mipo.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.340
I have all the stones in my hands now.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:47.510
Does this mean that all seven 
Prism Stones are together?

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:52.470
With this, Jyaku-King will be complete.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:58.670
With the Power of Creation, our Dotsuku 
Zone will be eternally immortal!

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.520
What in the world is happening?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:21.920
What happened?

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:22.870
I don't know...

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.190
I don't know, but...

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.430
It's the power of the 
seven Prism Stones mipo!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.190
It's an awesome power mepo!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.720
The Prism Stone came back mepo!

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:44.280
Mipo!

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:49.210
I had no idea that the power of the 
seven Prism Stones was this powerful...!

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:54.270
The power of the stones has 
backed him into a corner mepo.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:56.950
You may be able to defeat him now mipo!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.930
All right... This time we'll do it!

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:01.000
Black Thunder!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.370
White Thunder!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.750
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.600
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:20.410
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:29.600
All seven Prism Stones are behind 
the power of the Marble Screw mepo!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:34.520
I didn't know the power of the 
seven stones was this powerful...

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.280
Is it over?

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:07.290
It truly was a miracle.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:13.930
It's a Prism Stone...

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:15.810
Where's the Prism Hopish?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.690
Please come out, Stone Keeper...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.280
I'm saved!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.060
Keeper!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.310
What took you so long?

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.000
What kind of legendary 
warriors are you anyway?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.790
You sure took your sweet time!

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:29.800
Listen here!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.760
Do you realize what we've been through...?

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.060
Now... now...

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:38.610
We got the Prism Hopish back, 
so let it go already mepo.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.360
You're talking like an adult now...

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.210
You're making me mad.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.010
Here's another Prism Stone...

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.410
With this, you have five.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.380
And if you add the two stones 
that Mipple and Mepple have,

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.980
you have all seven stones now.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.450
Thank goodness! We're 
finally able to go home.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:02.180
But a lot of strange things 
happened at this training camp.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:05.350
Do you... think it had anything 
to do with the mountain god?

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.840
Hurry, and get on the bus!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:09.040
It's him!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:12.010
Thank goodness. I'm so glad.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:22.090
Mipple... we'll take out 
our Prism Stones mepo.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.230
Okay mipo.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.920
Give me the rest of the Prism Stones.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:36.850
Okay.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:42.370
I've seen this moment in 
my dreams so often mipo.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:46.490
With this, happiness will return to 
the Field of Light mepo. Go ahead...

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.320
Go ahead...

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:51.370
Are you sure? Will it be okay?

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.060
Nothing strange will happen, will it?

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:54.650
What's going to happen anyway?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.350
You don't know, do you?

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.310
Never mind, and just do it mepo!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.980
I can't count on anything you say.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.290
Nothing's happening!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.940
What's wrong? Come on...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:08.620
Come on...

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.310
Look mipo!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.930
It's awesome... A rainbow 
is coming out of my house.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.810
It looks like you can walk across it.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.420
It's so beautiful.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:43.250
I'm sure that rainbow is connected 
to the Field of Light mepo.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.620
Something's coming.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:57.810
Popo!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.760
I remembered something awful just now.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.290
Now what is it?

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.000
It's Pollun mepo!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:05.740
Pollun?

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.430
Pollun. Pollun!

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.720
I'm Pollun popo.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.400
Now it's "popo."

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.680
By any chance, did you come 
from the Field of Light?

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:19.090
I'm the Prince of the Field of Light 
who will guide you to the future popo.

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.150
We're going to the Field of Light popo.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.970
Go ahead...

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.350
Prince of Light...

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:25.630
Chosen Guardian...

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.590
Pretty Cure will come, too popo.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:32.180
There's a really big gap between your names 
and the way all of you look, isn't there?

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.560
Why are all the people from the 
Field of Light always like...?

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:38.090
We're going to the Field of Light, too?

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:41.290
Queen told me to being Pretty Cure back popo.

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.590
It's not possible, is it?

